{"page":538,"verses":[{"verse_key":"57:4","surah":57,"ayah":4,"ar_uthmani":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ فِى سِتَّةِ أَيَّامٍ ثُمَّ ٱسْتَوَىٰ عَلَى ٱلْعَرْشِ ۚ يَعْلَمُ مَا يَلِجُ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا يَخْرُجُ مِنْهَا وَمَا يَنزِلُ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ وَمَا يَعْرُجُ فِيهَا ۖ وَهُوَ مَعَكُمْ أَيْنَ مَا كُنتُمْ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ بَصِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It was He who created the heavens and earth in six Days and then established Himself on the throne. He knows what enters the earth and what comes out of it; what descends from the sky and what ascends to it. He is with you wherever you are; He sees all that you do;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":3,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سِتَّةِ","en_gloss":"six","transliteration":"sittati","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَيَّامٍۢ","en_gloss":"periods","transliteration":"ayyāmin","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ","en_gloss":"He rose","transliteration":"is'tawā","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْعَرْشِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the Throne","transliteration":"l-ʿarshi","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"He knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَلِجُ","en_glos