ṣīrun","verse_key":"57:4"},{"pos":37,"ar":"٤","en_gloss":"(4)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"57:4"}]},{"verse_key":"57:5","surah":57,"ayah":5,"ar_uthmani":"لَّهُۥ مُلْكُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَإِلَى ٱللَّهِ تُرْجَعُ ٱلْأُمُورُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"control of the heavens and earth belongs to Him. Everything is brought back to God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"For Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"57:5"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مُلْكُ","en_gloss":"(is the) dominion","transliteration":"mul'ku","verse_key":"57:5"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"57:5"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"57:5"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَإِلَى","en_gloss":"and to","transliteration":"wa-ilā","verse_key":"57:5"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"57:5"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تُرْجَعُ","en_gloss":"will be returned","transliteration":"tur'jaʿu","verse_key":"57:5"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأُمُورُ","en_gloss":"the matters","transliteration":"l-umūru","verse_key":"57:5"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٥","en_gloss":"(5)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"57:5"}]},{"verse_key":"57:6","surah":57,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"يُولِجُ ٱلَّيْلَ فِى ٱلنَّهَارِ وَيُولِجُ ٱلنَّهَارَ فِى ٱلَّيْلِ ۚ وَهُوَ عَلِيمٌۢ بِذَاتِ ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He makes night merge into day and day into night. He knows what is in every heart.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يُولِجُ","en_gloss":"He merges","transliteration":"yūliju","verse_key":"57:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلَ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layla","verse_key":"57:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"into","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"57:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","en_gloss":"the day","transliteration":"l-nahāri","verse_key":"57:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيُولِجُ","en_gloss":"and He merges","transliteration":"wayūliju","verse_key":"57:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"