hose","transliteration":"fa-alladhīna","verse_key":"57:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"57:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"57:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأَنفَقُوا۟","en_gloss":"and spend","transliteration":"wa-anfaqū","verse_key":"57:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"57:7"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَجْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a reward","transliteration":"ajrun","verse_key":"57:7"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كَبِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"kabīrun","verse_key":"57:7"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"57:7"}]},{"verse_key":"57:8","surah":57,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا لَكُمْ لَا تُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱللَّهِ ۙ وَٱلرَّسُولُ يَدْعُوكُمْ لِتُؤْمِنُوا۟ بِرَبِّكُمْ وَقَدْ أَخَذَ مِيثَـٰقَكُمْ إِن كُنتُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Why should you not believe in God when the Mes-senger calls you to believe in your Lord, and He has already made a pledge with you, if you have faith?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"57:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"57:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(that) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"57:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"you believe","transliteration":"tu'minūna","verse_key":"57:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ ۙ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"57:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلرَّسُولُ","en_gloss":"while the Messenger","transliteration":"wal-rasūlu","verse_key":"57:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَدْعُوكُمْ","en_gloss":"calls you","transliteration":"yadʿūkum","verse_key":"57:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِتُؤْمِنُوا۟","en_gloss":"that you believe","transliteration":"litu'minū","verse_key":"57:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِرَبِّكُمْ","en_gloss":"in your Lord","transliteration":"birabbikum","verse_key":